    {
      "source": "<code>locale</code> - the locale to expose",
      "translation": "<code>locale</code> - 要暴露的区域设置",
      "count": 3
    },
    {
      "source": "Note: Does not support <a href=\"#setLocaleContext(org.springframework.web.server.ServerWebExchange,org.springframework.context.i18n.LocaleContext)\"><code>setLocaleContext(ServerWebExchange, LocaleContext)</code></a>, as the fixed locale and\ntime zone cannot be changed.",
      "translation": "注意：不支持<a href=\"#setLocaleContext(org.springframework.web.server.ServerWebExchange,org.springframework.context.i18n.LocaleContext)\"><code>setLocaleContext(ServerWebExchange, LocaleContext)</code></a>，因为固定的区域设置和时区无法更改。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "Create a default FixedLocaleResolver, exposing a configured default\nlocale (or the JVM's default locale as fallback).",
      "translation": "创建一个默认的 FixedLocaleResolver，暴露配置的默认区域设置（或作为回退使用 JVM 的默认区域设置）。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "Create a FixedLocaleResolver that exposes the given locale.",
      "translation": "创建一个暴露给定区域的 FixedLocaleResolver。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "Create a FixedLocaleResolver that exposes the given locale and time zone.",
      "translation": "创建一个 `FixedLocaleResolver`，以暴露给定的区域设置和时区。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "Set the current locale context to the given one,\npotentially including a locale with associated time zone information.",
      "translation": "设置当前区域上下文为给定的一个，可能包含带有相关时区信息的区域。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "<code>timeZone</code> - the time zone to expose",
      "translation": "<code>timeZone</code> - 要暴露的时区",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "<code>exchange</code> - current server exchange",
      "translation": "<code>exchange</code> - 当前服务器交换",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "The returned context may be a\n<a href=\"../../../context/i18n/TimeZoneAwareLocaleContext.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.context.i18n\"><code>TimeZoneAwareLocaleContext</code></a>,\ncontaining a locale with associated time zone information.\nSimply apply an <code>instanceof</code> check and downcast accordingly.",
      "translation": "返回的上下文可能是`<a href=\"../../../context/i18n/TimeZoneAwareLocaleContext.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.context.i18n\"><code>TimeZoneAwareLocaleContext</code></a>`，其中包含带有关联时区信息的区域设置。只需应用一个 `<code>instanceof</code>` 检查并相应地进行向下转换即可。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "Custom resolver implementations may also return extra settings in\nthe returned context, which again can be accessed through downcasting.",
      "translation": "自定义解析器实现也可以在返回的上下文中返回额外的设置，这些设置同样可以通过向下转型进行访问。",
      "count": 1
    },
